{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":493924,"name":"金保 赖","username":"heyun","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/h/e47774/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T11:36:02.341Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTitle:\u003c/strong\u003e Grok Bot “Send failed” while weekly usage still available (Pro, ~61%)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBody:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHi,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot suddenly stopped working. Messages fail with \u003cstrong\u003e“Send failed / Resend / Delete”\u003c/strong\u003e, and the bot does not reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat I see\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExisting bot chat (e.g. “打菲系统优化”) previously worked and returned long replies\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNew messages now fail to send (red “Send failed”)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetry / resend still fails\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSame issue continues after waiting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUsage / billing (not exhausted)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlan: \u003cstrong\u003ePro\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeekly usage: about \u003cstrong\u003e61%\u003c/strong\u003e used\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset in about \u003cstrong\u003e5 days\u003c/strong\u003e (around \u003cstrong\u003eSep 22\u003c/strong\u003e)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMonthly on-demand limit: \u003cstrong\u003eNone\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSo this does \u003cstrong\u003enot\u003c/strong\u003e look like a trial/usage exhaustion case\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAlready tried\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConfirmed Usage \u0026amp; Billing still shows remaining weekly usage\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDid \u003cstrong\u003enot\u003c/strong\u003e reset the Agent Computer (to avoid wiping data)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAsk\u003c/strong\u003e Please check whether this account’s Grok Bot runner / send pipeline is stuck on the backend, and recover it if needed \u003cstrong\u003ewithout\u003c/strong\u003e resetting the Agent Computer. Bots, chats, and files should be preserved.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHappy to provide account email / app version / request IDs privately if needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-17T11:46:32.804Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":12,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":61.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172017,"topic_slug":"grok-bot","display_username":"金保 赖","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":138390,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot/172017/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":493992,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T12:18:07.089Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e5 posts were merged into an existing topic: \u003ca href=\"/t/some-of-the-bots-became-unresponsive-failed-to-send-on-my-messages-to-them/171858\"\u003eSome of the bots became unresponsive (failed to send on my messages to them)\u00